# Line endings.
#
# Every source file in this repository is stored with LF, whatever the machine
# it was edited on uses. Without this, working on WSL — where a Windows editor
# or a checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` can rewrite a file's endings without
# changing a character of it — produces a diff that looks like the whole
# repository has been rewritten.
#
# It is not a tidiness rule. The last release had 435 files "modified" that
# differed from HEAD by nothing but their line endings, and 44 that carried the
# actual work. A 98,000-line diff with the real change buried in it cannot be
# reviewed, and the release discipline this project keeps failing at starts with
# being able to read what is about to be committed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries, left exactly as they are.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.otf binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
